  text: " <i>[ALERT SENT TO HIGHER-UPS]</i>  \n \n<link>A-15</link> is an (REDACTED)
    polymorphic (REDA) lifeform. It can take the shape of, and mimic to perfection,
    any being that it (REDACTED) into direct contact. \r\nThe (REDA) can harness
    complete knowledge of whatever (REDA) (REDACTED) as there are clearly (REDACTED)
    influences at play: somehow the (REDA) possesses its own will (RE).  \r\nIt is
    extremely attracted to (RE)-(RE) DNA, Its behaviour shifting violently when in
    close proximity to a being not YET added to its engorged genetic pool. \r\n \r\n
    \r \nThe specimen was found outside of the (RE)  (REDA) insides, which made capture
    possible thanks to (RE) (REDACTED) in (REDACTED) space (REDA). \r\nIts original
    form is unknown, and due to its need to (REDACTED) it was originally thought
    as harmless,  likely of a class (REDA)-(RE). \r\n\r \n \r\n               -/<i>CONTEXTUAL
    EDIT</i>/- \n---------------------------------------------- \r \n \r\n<link>A-15</link>
    possesses an instantaneous regenerative (RE)-system, in conjunction with its
    polymorphy, that allows to (REDACTED),  it is not simple (REDA), making it of
    the highest value for experimentation and processing as an all in one subject_\r
    \n\r \n \r\n               -/<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/- \n----------------------------------------------
    \r\r \n<b>BEHAVIORAL PROFILE:</b> (REDACTED) are naturally (REDA) and (REDACTED)
    (REDACTED) (REDACTED) so (REDACTED) when conditions are optimal for (REDACTED).
    Avoid (REDACTED) if (REDACTED) at all costs. It could be ANYONE/ANYTHING.  \n\r
    \n<i>CURRENTELY KNOWN GENETIC POOL ACQUIRED:</i> \r\n  \n- Human \n- (REDACTED)
